    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this charming 2 bedroomed mid-terrace townhouse, located within easy walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe. Presented to the market in excellent turn-key condition, the property represents an ideal starter, down-sizer or holiday home opportunity for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To include - Entrance Hall, Open-Plan Lounge/Dining Area, Kitchenette, 2 Bedrooms & Family Bathroom.."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Open-Plan Lounge/Dining Area - \r\n\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Area - 5.23m x 3.95m \r\nLaminated grey oak timber floor. Multi-burning stove in timber surround fireplace with tiled insert & Liscannor stone hearth. Timber ceiling. Stairs to first floor. Double French doors to rear patio area. Storage area.\r\n\r\nKitchenette - 2.91m x 1.86m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Fully fitted country cream units to include sink unit, extractor & wooden work-top. Plumbed for gas cooker. Over-counter tiling. Spot lighting. Gas boiler to central heating system.\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.9m x 1.49m \r\nLaminated dark oak timber floor. Wall lights. Attic access.\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.89m x 1.86m \r\nCeramic tiled floor & fully tiled around bath & shower area. Shower unit over bath, WC & WHB with under-storage. Radiator towel rail. \nStorage unit with plumbing for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.35m x 2.3m \r\nCurrently used as home office. Laminated dark oak timber floor. Overhead window allowing natural light through. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 2 - 4.03m x 2.73m \r\nLaminated dark oak timber floor. Dual aspect windows to include overhead skylight windows allowing natural light through.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Mains gas central heating. Mains water & sewerage.\r\nPVC double glazed windows & hardwood front & rear entrance doors.\r\nEnclosed rear yard & patio area. Open storage shed. Outside tap.\r\nOriginally built in 1883 & renovated & upgraded 2018/19."
      },
      {
